00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.280
Thank you.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:43.030
Hello, how are you? Welcome to my kitchen.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:45.290
My name is Jeff Smith, the Frugal Gourmet.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.600
And today I want to talk to you about salt and animal fat.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:49.930
consumption in America.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.760
Why would I bore you with such a thing?

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.630
No, I'm not a health food fanatic.

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:55.790
Not at all.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:57.280
I'm not even a vegetarian.

00:00:58.310 --> 00:00:59.910
but a few months ago i underwent open

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.500
heart surgery.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:05.680
At the hands of a very brilliant physician in Seattle a fellow by the name of dr. Lester Savage

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:09.880
And he told me that if I didn't if I did not have this new valve put in my heart

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.000
I would be dead within a month

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:13.680
Now that's a pretty impressive.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:15.390
a bit of information.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:22.260
I remember how exciting it was to wake up after the surgery and know that your heart has been repaired and that you're going to hold on.

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:26.860
They wheeled me back to my own room after being in intensive care for a few days.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:28.720
Then they brought me my first meal.

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:30.980
Aha!

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:32.320
Please understand.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:36.860
that this doctor had saved my life, and then four dieticians tried to kill me.

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:38.390
I swear to you.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:42.090
that I've never eaten anything so pale, so boring in my life.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:46.380
What was the issue? Well, they were very concerned about keeping my heart healthy from then on.

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:48.900
And they wanted me to cut down on salt and fat.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:52.960
Now, my problem with the heart valve did not come about because of bad diet.

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:55.890
You could accuse me of a lot of sins, but not bad diet.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:59.000
In any case, my valve blew out.

00:01:59.150 --> 00:01:59.890
when I was a child.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:01.940
in the midst of rheumatic fever.

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:03.610
So the doctor repaired this part.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:05.640
And then I began to realize,

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.640
how difficult it is for people

