00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.700
The salt goes into your blood system, thus increasing the salt content or the saline content.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.730
When the saline content in your blood system is too high,

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:58.690
your body automatically begins pumping in more water to your blood system to dilute the salt,

00:02:59.340 --> 00:02:59.980
